      <p className="legal-clause min-w-0 break-words pl-4 sm:pl-5"><strong className="font-semibold text-pelagic-charcoal">8.7</strong> In the event that the Company is held liable to the Client under the Agreement and a Third Party is also held liable in respect of the same claim, the Company shall only bear liability to the extent that such loss is attributable to the Company. The Client’s failure or inability to recover its loss from the Third Party shall not increase the Company’s liability hereunder.</p>
