      <p className="legal-clause min-w-0 break-words pl-4 sm:pl-5"><strong className="font-semibold text-pelagic-charcoal">15.1</strong> Duration of Work / Timeline. The Company will make every reasonable effort to adhere to the proposed timelines for completion of the engineering assessment as outlined in the work scope. However, due to the nature of the work, which involves detailed technical evaluations and assessments, the timeline may be subject to change based on the complexity and findings that arise during the assessment process. The Company expressly disclaims any liability for delays in completion of the assessment arising from circumstances outside the Company’s reasonable control, delays or failures by the Client or Third Parties, changes in scope, incomplete or inaccurate information, restricted access, or circumstances identified during the Services requiring further investigation, including but not limited to any consequential, incidental or indirect damages or losses that may result from such delays. By accepting the proposal, the Client acknowledges and agrees that the Company shall not be held liable for any costs, expenses or liabilities incurred as a result of delays, irrespective of the cause of such delays.</p>
